Rule {Number} ({Description})\n{Rule Definition}
Ex) Rule 21 (primitive type variable should not be zero)
    {v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≠ 0

[Example Rules]
Rule 5 (index tensor (v_2) should be within the range of input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= min(v_2) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : max(v_2) ≤ shape(v_1, i) − 1

Rule 14 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 10 (valid 2D transposed convolution)
